OL,3,GNEWSAHomes planned close to bottleneck
OL,4,ABroads bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 238 homes in a village
OL,7,Fhave sparked fears it will create
OL,8,Ffurther traffic problems at a
OL,9,Fbottleneck bridge.
OL,11,FFW Properties has applied to North
OL,12,FNorfolk District Council build the
OL,13,Fproperties in Hoveton, on land off
OL,14,FTunstead Road and Stalham Road.
OL,16,FThey could be built on farmland to the
OL,17,Fnorth of Wroxham Bridge, which
OL,18,Fregularly sees traffic backed up,
OL,19,Fcausing queues that can stretch back
OL,20,Fmiles.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
