OL,3,GNEWSAHomes planned close to bottleneck
OL,4,ABroads bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Dixon, Conservative district
OL,7,Fcouncillor for Hoveton, said the
OL,8,Ftraffic was a "major problem" for the
OL,9,Farea but acknowledged that the
OL,10,Fdevelopment could help create
OL,11,Fmuch-needed housing for families.
